[{"ave_id":"AVE-2011-0025","file_name":"2011/AVE-2011-0025.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2011-4723","title":"D-Link DIR-300 明文密码存储信息泄露漏洞","description":"D-Link DIR-300 路由器存在明文密码存储漏洞，设备在固件或配置文件中以明文形式存储管理员及用户密码，未进行任何加密或哈希处理。攻击者通过物理接触设备、访问管理后台或利用其他漏洞获取路由器文件系统访问权限后，可直接读取明文凭据，进而完全控制路由器及内网。该漏洞影响 D-Link DIR-300 系列路由器，CVSS 评分 5.7，危害等级中危。厂商未发布官方修复补丁，建议用户限制设备物理访问并升级至支持安全存储的固件版本。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.7,"aliases":["CVE-2011-4723"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2011-12-20T11:55:08.413","updated":"2026-06-16T23:35:18.387","remediation":"D-Link DIR-300 路由器已停止技术支持（EOL），官方不再发布固件更新。强烈建议立即停用该设备并更换为受支持的路由器产品。如无法立即更换，应将该路由器隔离在独立 VLAN 中，仅允许受信任的管理主机通过 LAN 口访问管理界面，同时在防火墙上限制对 80/443 端口的远程访问，并禁用 WAN 端管理功能以降低密码明文泄露风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://en.securitylab.ru/lab/PT-2011-30","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2011-4723","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2011/CVE-2011-4723.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/377bb49f7479dd297ab5004f75a37c291a136578/cves/2011/4xxx/CVE-2011-4723.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2011/CVE-2011-4723","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/4a810b0db2e9cab67156f722c309e925ee8f02a0/2011/4xxx/CVE-2011-4723.json","https://github.com/a-dhaou-tekup/VRA/blob/3e4f21c329250c5eca327489d3fd5be9b398ce7b/data/rag_corpus/cisa_kev_notes/CVE-2011-4723.txt","https://github.com/cyberdudebivash/cyberdudebivash-ai-security-hub/blob/13403e1745f63237e7ef6d51562fb36112320d77/frontend/cve/CVE-2011-4723.html","https://github.com/Ostorlab/KEV/blob/8feadeb8b7ff54359eab87941769781629146b23/README.md","https://github.com/lucacapacci/cisa_kev/blob/730547e3121e93fb4d300346c9d4aa5d5b39b4fc/data_single/2011/CVE-2011-4723.csv","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/db909d46c3d9b98ec1f95daa3c88d7a8990ea8f5/advisories/unreviewed/2022/05/GHSA-cqpf-hj5r-9893/GHSA-cqpf-hj5r-9893.json","https://github.com/RESETHACKER-COMMUNITY/Pentesting-Bugbounty/blob/59cac7d23fabc7882f502fd3b35da5042c6edcf2/ResetCybersecuirty/CVE's/Readme.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2011/POC-AVE-2011-0025.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2011/AVE-2011-0025.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2011-0016","file_name":"2011/AVE-2011-0016.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2011-4804","title":"Joomla! obSuggest组件 本地文件包含漏洞","description":"Joomla! com_kp (obSuggest/com_obsuggest) 组件 1.8 版本前存在目录遍历漏洞，攻击者可通过 index.php 的 controller 参数传入 ../ 目录遍历序列，实现任意文件读取。该漏洞影响 Joomla! 使用该组件的站点，远程未认证攻击者即可利用，通过构造包含目录遍历序列的 controller 参数读取服务器任意敏感文件（如 /etc/passwd、配置文件等），CVSS 评分 5.0（中危），CWE-22 路径遍历类型。官方已在 1.8 版本修复，建议升级组件至 1.8 或更高版本。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2011-4804"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2011-12-14T00:55:04.810","updated":"2026-06-16T23:35:26.000","remediation":"升级 Joomla! com_kp (com_obsuggest) 组件至 1.8 或更高版本；若暂时无法升级，可在 Web 应用防火墙 (WAF) 或 .htaccess 中拦截包含 \"..\" 或 \"controller=..\" 的请求参数，禁止目录穿越字符传入 controller 参数。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-15T00:00:00Z","references":["http://foobla.com/news/latest/obsuggest-1.8-security-release.html","http://secunia.com/advisories/46844","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/48944","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/36598","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2011/CVE-2011-4804.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/8600ac0c091970175de0b53d9682f50858aef8dc/2011/CVE-2011-4804.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/6bfef5eb290cbfeb2b2cb4d2bae8e5cab0243137/http/cves/2011/CVE-2011-4804.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/14c8304a12469a26a8cf0f12d33579256a31685e/cves/2011/4xxx/CVE-2011-4804.json","https://github.com/0xKayala/Custom-Nuclei-Templates/blob/1940dfd29577590f076c89dec5c30d809d68f210/