ecurity-announce/2012-01/msg00019.html","http://lists.opensuse.org/opensuse-security-announce/2012-01/msg00020.html","http://www.adobe.com/support/security/advisories/apsa11-04.html","http://www.adobe.com/support/security/bulletins/apsb11-30.html","http://www.adobe.com/support/security/bulletins/apsb12-01.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2012-0011.html","http://www.us-cert.gov/cas/techalerts/TA11-350A.html","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A14562","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/issues/199","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2011-2462","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/18366","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2011/CVE-2011-2462.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/7d4778b18ea29de57c8a889212050a9d38e2d2cb/cves/2011/2xxx/CVE-2011-2462.json","https://github.com/stamparm/maltrail/blob/cc8d45f6e59acbd859e1a1046f87573663eeff61/trails/static/malware/sykipot.txt","https://github.com/jesparza/peepdf/blob/c74dc65c0ac7e506bae4f2582a2435ec50741f40/README.md","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2011/CVE-2011-2462","https://github.com/fankh/vulnerability-poc/blob/ffa50060b7ba6ae58d60d6d90533e77eaf10d466/2011/CVE-2011-2462/README_KO.md","https://github.com/e-m-b-a/emba/blob/4d0f24b3edae0bdb5391177851bad3be54ecea0f/config/msf_cve-db.txt","https://github.com/cyberdudebivash/cyberdudebivash-ai-security-hub/blob/13403e1745f63237e7ef6d51562fb36112320d77/frontend/cve/CVE-2011-2462.html","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/1b84eedba993546f37a880c6d2d084176a1f04a7/SSVC/data/2011/CVE-2011-2462.json","https://github.com/a-dhaou-tekup/VRA/blob/3e4f21c329250c5eca327489d3fd5be9b398ce7b/data/rag_corpus/cisa_kev_notes/CVE-2011-2462.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2011/AVE-2011-0088.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2011-0099","file_name":"2011/AVE-2011-0099.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2011-3402","title":"Microsoft Windows TrueType 字体解析引擎远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Windows 内核模式驱动 win32k.sys 中的 TrueType 字体解析引擎存在内存破坏漏洞，远程攻击者可通过诱导用户打开包含特制字体数据的 Word 文档或访问恶意网页触发该漏洞，导致系统内核层面远程代码执行。该漏洞已被 Duqu 蠕虫在 2011 年 11 月利用于真实攻击，影响 Windows XP SP2/SP3、Server 2003 SP2、Vista SP2、Server 2008 SP2/R2/R2 SP1 及 Windows 7 Gold/SP1 等多个版本。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.8,"aliases":["CVE-2011-3402"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2011-11-04T21:55:04.693","updated":"2026-06-16T23:33:14.020","remediation":"立即安装 Microsoft 安全公告 MS11-087 对应的更新 KB2639417。可通过 Windows Update 自动更新，或从 Microsoft 下载中心手动下载安装。受影响系统包括 Windows XP SP2/SP3、Windows Server 2003 SP2、Windows Vista SP2、Windows Server 2008 SP2/R2/R2 SP1、Windows 7 Gold/SP1。如无法立即打补丁，可在管理员命令行下执行 `icacls \"%windir%\\system32\\t2embed.dll\" /deny *S-1-1-0:(F)` 拒绝访问 T2EMBED.DLL 作为临时缓解措施，注意此操作会影响依赖嵌入字体的应用程序（如 PDF 生成）。安装更新后需撤销该缓解措施以恢复功能。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://blogs.mcafee.com/mcafee-labs/the-day-of-the-golden-jackal-%E2%80%93-further-tales-of-the-stuxnet-files","http://blogs.technet.com/b/msrc/archive/2011/11/03/microsoft-releases-security-advisory-2639658.aspx","http://isc.sans.edu/diary/Duqu+Mitigation/11950","http://secunia.com/advisories/49121","http://secunia.com/advisories/49122","http://technet.microsoft.com/security/advisory/2639658","http://www.securelist.com/en/blog/208193197/The_Mystery_of_Duqu_Part_Two","http://www.securitytracker.com/id?1027039","http://www.symantec.com/connect/w32-duqu_status-updates_installer-zero-day-exploit","http://www.symantec.com/content/en/us/enterprise/media/security_response/whitepapers/w32_duqu_the_precursor_to_the_next_stuxnet.pdf","http://www.us-cert.gov/cas/techalerts/TA11-347A.html","http://www.us-cert.gov/cas/techalerts/TA12-129A.html","http://www.us-cert.gov/cas/techalerts/TA12-164A.html","h