w_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2011/AVE-2011-0099.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2011-0009","file_name":"2011/AVE-2011-0009.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2011-3171","title":"{\"_meta\":{},\"stopReason\":\"end_turn\",\"usage\":{\"cachedReadTokens\":1664,\"inputTokens\":9152,\"outputTokens\":22,\"totalTokens\":10838}}","description":"Pure-FTPd 1.0.22 及可能其他版本在 SUSE Linux Enterprise Server 及其他启用 Netware OES 远程服务器功能的操作系统上存在目录遍历漏洞。当启用 Netware OES 远程服务器功能时，本地攻击者可通过未知攻击向量利用路径遍历漏洞覆盖系统任意文件。该漏洞源于对文件路径验证不充分，攻击者需具备本地访问权限且目标系统需启用 OES 远程功能才能利用，CVSS 评分 3.6，属低危漏洞，影响 Pure-FTPd 1.0.22 及可能受影响的其他版本。","severity":"LOW","score":3.6,"aliases":["CVE-2011-3171"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2011-11-04T21:55:02.550","updated":"2026-06-16T23:32:47.807","remediation":"升级 Pure-FTPd 至 1.0.32 或更高版本（SUSE 用户通过 `zypper update pure-ftpd` 安装官方补丁）。若无法立即升级，请在 pure-ftpd 配置中禁用 Netware OES 远程服务器功能（移除或注释 `OES` 相关配置项并重启服务），并限制仅有可信用户具备本地登录权限，以缓解任意文件覆盖风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-15T00:00:00Z","references":["http://lists.opensuse.org/opensuse-security-announce/2011-09/msg00015.html","http://lists.opensuse.org/opensuse-security-announce/2011-09/msg00016.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/49541","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/69686","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/network/cves/2011/CVE-2011-3171.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/8600ac0c091970175de0b53d9682f50858aef8dc/2011/CVE-2011-3171.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/6bfef5eb290cbfeb2b2cb4d2bae8e5cab0243137/network/cves/2011/CVE-2011-3171.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/4e7bd0957d7eea7c21095268cca9721e428611ed/cves/2011/3xxx/CVE-2011-3171.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2011/CVE-2011-3171","https://github.com/nottrobin/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/36e411296b5707284049ec2e0db8d2622feca498/retired/CVE-2011-3171","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x50000/49541/info.html","https://github.com/vito1317/ai-weakness-scan/blob/530cc6a27c6af8957110e6c1f64edc534d36af1b/data/cvelistV5_raw/extracted/cvelistV5-main/cves/2011/3xxx/CVE-2011-3171.json","https://github.com/kees/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/66a43c37da527bc16621fb5548dca8aa1f46e537/retired/CVE-2011-3171","https://github.com/hungryfoolou/Vulnerability_Mining/blob/3df1d8ed0489ae1228f975ae1f58a690aae53886/craw/cveid_craw/cveid_craw/data/cveid_by_kind/cveid_dirtra.txt","https://github.com/8yumzy88/nuclei-templates/blob/f0baec1d529f779bea6b459424ce11daf8c83f27/network/cves/2011/CVE-2011-3171.yaml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2011/AVE-2011-0009.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2011-0010","file_name":"2011/AVE-2011-0010.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2011-3315","title":"Cisco Unified Communications Manager 及 Unified Contact Center Express 目录遍历漏洞","description":"多个 Cisco 统一通信产品存在目录遍历漏洞（CVE-2011-3315，CNVD-2011-4503），影响 Cisco Unified Communications Manager (CUCM) 5.x、6.x（6.1(5)SU2 前）、7.x（7.1(5b)SU2 前）、8.x（8.0(3) 前），以及 Cisco Unified Contact Center Express (UCCX) 与 Unified IP IVR 多个版本（6.0(1)SR1ES8 前、7.0(x)（7.0(2)ES1 前）、8.0(x) 至 8.0(2)SU3、8.5(x)（8.5(1)SU2 前））。攻击者可通过构造包含目录遍历序列（如 `../`）的恶意 URL 请求，利用 `file` 参数处理缺陷，未经身份认证即可遍历目录读取服务器上任意文件（如配置文件、日志、敏感凭证等），CVSS 评分 7.8（高危），CWE-22 目录遍历。攻击条件为攻击者可网络访问目标 Web 管理接口，无需认证。利用方式为发送包含 `../` 序列的 HTTP 请求读取敏感文件。Cisco 已发布补丁修复（CSCth09343、CSCts44049）。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.8,"aliases":["CVE-2011-3315"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2011-10-27T21:55:00.823","updated":"2026-06-16T23:33:04.147","remediation":"建议将 Cisco Unified Communications Manager (CUCM) 升级至 6.1(5)SU2、7.1(5b)SU2 或 8.0(3) 及以上版本；将 Cisco Unified Contact Center Express (UCCX) 与 Unified IP-IVR 升级至 6.0(1)SR1ES8、7.0(2)ES1、8.0(2)SU3 或 8.5(1)SU2 及以上版本。如暂时无法升级，应在边界防火墙或反向代理上限制对 CUCM/UCCX Web 管理接口的源 IP 访问并禁用不必要的 HTTP 目录访问，以缓解任意文件读取风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-15T00:00:00Z","references":["http://tools.cisco.com/security/center/content/CiscoSecurityAdvisory/cisco-sa-20111026-cucm","http://tools.cisco.com/security/center/content/CiscoSecurityAdvisory/cisco-sa-20111026-uccx","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/36256","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2011/CVE-2011-3315.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/8600ac0c091970175de0b53d9682f50858aef8dc/2011/CVE-2011-3315.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/6bfef5eb290cbfeb2b2cb4d2bae8e5cab0243137/http/cves/2011/CVE-2011-3315.yaml","https://github.com/sepehrdaddev/zap-scripts/blob/2b63b02ca79cc7f0023cdbab72c5c6c774354b07/active/CVE-2011-3315.js","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/4e7bd0957d7eea7c21095268cca9721e428611ed/cves/2011/3xxx/CVE-2011-3315.json","https://github.com/cckuailong/reapoc/blob/699762e4c31d0183733f64313d8fc3be6470bd37/2011/README.md","https://github.com/adampielak/nuclei-templates/blob/ac9605f5a915670fd80cb4e1904f4435f1835b65/nuclei-v2/C/cve-2011-3315.yaml","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/3ff6a73162d852f34c14a0105fd7d93a0a7368b2/2011/CVE-2011-3315.json","https://github.com/u21h2/nacs/blob/1eaa239ded7496317a47073605c8ddda70686ef5/web/poc/pocs_dev/nucleibak/cves/2011/CVE-2011-3315.yaml","https://github.com/coreruleset/seaweed-reports/blob/3e2a1bd3dbca1b431f18ed0dabb71fa729d4d059/2022/Sep/26/lfiArtifact/lfiReport.csv","https://github.com/0xKayala/Custom-Nuclei-Templates/blob/1940dfd29577590f076c89dec5c30d809d68f210/6001-to-7000-templates/cve-2011-3315-2061.yaml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2011/AVE-2011-0010.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2011-0100","file_name":"2011/AVE-2011-0100.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2011-3544","title":"Oracle Java SE JDK及JRE Scripting组件远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Oracle Java SE 的 Java Runtime Environment 组件中的 Scripting 子组件存在未指定漏洞，远程攻击者可通过诱导用户访问恶意网页，触发 Java Web Start 应用程序或 Java Applet 调用 Rhino 脚本引擎，在未经沙箱授权的情况下执行任意代码，导致目标系统机密性、完整性和可用性完全丧失。该漏洞影响 Oracle Java SE JDK 和 JRE 7 及 6 Update 27 及更早版本，CVSS 评分 9.8，危害等级严重。Oracle 已在 2011 年 10 月关键补丁更新中修复此漏洞。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.8,"aliases":["CVE-2011-3544"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2011-10-19T21:55:01.097","updated":"2026-06-16T23:33:27.053","remediation":"立即升级 Java SE 至 JDK/JRE 6 Update 29 及以上版本，或 JDK/JRE 7 Update 1 及以上版本。从 Oracle Java Archive 下载对应平台的最新更新包进行安装。如无法立即升级，可在浏览器中禁用 Java Applet 支持（控制面板 → Java → 安全 → 取消勾选\"启用 Java 内容\"），并卸载不需要的 Java 运行时环境以减小攻击面。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://lists.opensuse.org/opensuse-security-announce/2012-01/msg00049.html","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=132750579901589&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=134254866602253&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=134254957702612&w=2","http://rhn.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2013-1455.html","http://secunia.com/advisories/48308","http://security.gentoo.org/glsa/glsa-201406-32.xml","http://www.ibm.com/developerworks/java/jdk/alerts/","http://www.oracle.com/technetwork/topics/security/javacpuoct2011-443431.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2011-1384.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/50218","http://www.securitytracker.com/id?1026215","http://www.ubuntu.com/usn/USN-1263-1","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/70849","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A13947","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2011-3544","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/18171","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2011/CVE-2011-3544.md","https://github.com/mthcht/awesome-lists/blob/3f571ea8ff2a06e146f8c15c646a3bbc468b1d9e/Lists/Others/Defender_yara_rules/Java/Exploit/CVE-2011-3544.yara","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/2726c8e981acc1c694a4bf2f24fcc9360825f783/2011/3xxx/CVE-2011-3544.json","https://github.com/roadwy/DefenderYara/blob/59e39903d9e6667c7c3e55a1f2887f1faab0e423/Exploit/WinNT/CVE-2011-3544/Exploit_WinNT_CVE-2011-3544_AV.yar","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2011/CVE-2011-3544","https://github.com/fankh/vulnerability-poc/blob/ffa50060b7ba6ae58d60d6d90533e77eaf10d466/2011/CVE-2011-3544/README.md","https://github.com/e-m-b-a/emba/blob/4d0f24b3edae0bdb5391177851bad3be54ecea0f/config/msf_cve-db.txt","https://github.com/killvxk/thg-framework/blob/fab929cd77c91373ebc4212bd4e5891b54f0fb1b/data/source/exploits/CVE-2011-3544/Exploit.java","https://github.com/vulncheck-oss/0day.today.archive/blob/3664abdd71985a44aff3260896a8f36e2f4a9682/remote-exploits/17217.txt","https://github.com/cyberdudebivash/cyberdudebivash-ai-security-hub/blob/13403e1745f63237e7ef6d51562fb36112320d77/frontend/cve/CVE-2011-3544.html"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2011/POC-AVE-2011-0100.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2011/AVE-2011-0100.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2011-0077","file_name":"2011/AVE-2011-0077.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2011-2005","title":"Microsoft Windows AFD.sys 本地权限提升漏洞","description":"Microsoft Windows 辅助功能驱动程序（afd.sys）存在权限提升漏洞。该驱动未正确验证从用户模式传递到内核模式的输入，本地攻击者可通过运行特制应用程序触发漏洞，从而在目标系统上以提升的权限执行任意代码。该漏洞影响 Windows XP SP2/SP3 及 Server 2003 SP2 版本，Microsoft 已在 MS11-080 安全公告中发布补丁修复。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.8,"aliases":["CVE-2011-2005"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2011-10-12T02:52:43.910","updated":"2026-06-16T23:30:35.373","remediation":"安装 Microsoft 安全公告 MS11-080 对应补丁 (KB2592799)，升级至 Windows XP SP3 最新补丁包或 Windows Server 2003 SP2 最新补丁包。如无法打补丁，建议删除或禁用 afd.sys 驱动文件（需注意可能影响网络功能），并通过组策略限制非管理员用户登录系统以降低攻击面。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/2011/ms11-080","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A13114","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2011-2005","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/18176","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2011/CVE-2011-2005.md","https://github.com/Ascotbe/Kernelhub/blob/e55eb366bab445539ff16c63d3831ed4af91c92f/Windows/CVE-2011-2005/README.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/7d4778b18ea29de57c8a889212050a9d38e2d2cb/cves/2011/2xxx/CVE-2011-2005.json","https://github.com/Al1ex/WindowsElevation/blob/e8fa2760f0ea29d1cdc759c623021d5ab7b715e2/CVE-2011-2005/CVE-2011-2005.py","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2011/CVE-2011-2005","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/2726c8e981acc1c694a4bf2f24fcc9360825f783/2011/2xxx/CVE-2011-2005.json","https://github.com/a-dhaou-tekup/VRA/blob/3e4f21c329250c5eca327489d3fd5be9b398ce7b/data/rag_corpus/cisa_kev_notes/CVE-2011-2005.txt","https://github.com/abatchy17/WindowsExploits/blob/5e9c25cda54fe33fb6e1fd3ae60512a1113b41df/MS11-080%20-%20AFD.sys/MS11-080.py","https://github.com/brianwrf/WinSystemHelper/blob/941c38ec4a6ffa66e2fb89cb6e2fb41aedec208e/explt2003.txt","https://github.com/riusksk/vul_war/blob/c9c5b9b0e0649997259323423a634b80763aef0f/abstract_contents_english.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2011/AVE-2011-0077.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2011-0008","file_name":"2011/AVE-2011-0008.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2011-2780","title":"Chyrp 2.x gz.php 文件参数目录遍历任意文件读取漏洞","description":"Chyrp 2.0 及更早版本的 includes/lib/gz.php 文件存在目录遍历漏洞。该脚本在处理 file 参数时未对用户输入进行充分过滤与校验，导致远程攻击者可在参数中插入\"..\"(点号点号)序列跳出网站根目录限制。攻击者在无需身份认证的情况下，仅需向目标服务器发送包含恶意路径的 HTTP 请求，即可读取服务器上的任意文件，如配置文件、源代码或敏感系统文件等，进而造成信息泄露。该漏洞影响所有运行 Chyrp 2.0 及之前版本且未打补丁的站点，利用方式简单，仅需构造包含目录遍历序列的 URL 即可触发。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2011-2780"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2011-07-19T21:55:00.837","updated":"2026-06-16T23:31:59.280","remediation":"建议升级 Chyrp 至 2.1 及以上版本（官方已修复该目录遍历漏洞），或手动修复 includes/lib/gz.php 中的 file 参数过滤逻辑，增加路径规范化与目录遍历防护（如使用 realpath 验证路径是否在允许目录内）。临时缓解可在 Web 服务器层面配置规则拦截包含 ../ 的 file 参数请求。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-15T00:00:00Z","references":["http://osvdb.org/73891","http://secunia.com/advisories/45184","http://securityreason.com/securityalert/8312","http://www.justanotherhacker.com/advisories/JAHx113.txt","http://www.ocert.org/advisories/ocert-2011-001.html","http://www.openwall.com/lists/oss-security/2011/07/13/5","http://www.openwall.com/lists/oss-security/2011/07/13/6","http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/518890/100/0/threaded","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/48672","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/68565","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/35946","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2011/CVE-2011-2780.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/8600ac0c091970175de0b53d9682f50858aef8dc/2011/CVE-2011-2780.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/6bfef5eb290cbfeb2b2cb4d2bae8e5cab0243137/http/cves/2011/CVE-2011-2780.yaml","https://github.com/sepehrdaddev/zap-scripts/blob/2b63b02ca79cc7f0023cdbab72c5c6c774354b07/active/CVE-2011-2780.js","https://github.com/0xKayala/Custom-Nuclei-Templates/blob/1940dfd29577590f076c89dec5c30d809d68f210/6001-to-7000-templates/cve-2011-2780-2052.yaml","https://github.com/1in9e/gosint/blob/bdda4461515c4398c08638676bbbfe451b73ff95/client/vuln_scan/nuclei/tools/nuclei-templates/cves/2011/CVE-2011-2780.yaml","https://github.com/adampielak/nuclei-templates/blob/ac9605f5a915670fd80cb4e1904f4435f1835b65/nuclei-v3/C/CVE-2011-2780_20.yaml","https://github.com/linuxadi/40k-nuclei-templates/blob/542be6820c801c02a33aee60f1c05ca7b0b5005f/aditya/folder1/cve-2011-2780-2052.yaml","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--3ba1ba47-d8dd-4841-8204-dcde71faa6c8.json","https://github.com/0xelixer/new/blob/6f6dd4a43a76ce74c1e8cc0558629a2ea198286e/nuclei-temps/Vulnerability-Templates/template2/cve-2011-2780-2056.yaml","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/bb01f7bb9f9641b9b1c18c8bce69c7bfeef56677/advisories/unreviewed/2022/05/GHSA-v4h8-98x3-fcrp/GHSA-v4h8-98x3-fcrp.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2011/AVE-2011-0008.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2011-0007","file_name":"2011/AVE-2011-0007.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2011-2744","title":"Chyrp Chyrp 2.0/2.1 路径遍历漏洞","description":"Chyrp 2.1 及更早版本（含 2.0）在默认 URI 的请求处理中存在目录遍历（CWE-22）漏洞。远程攻击者无需身份认证，只需在请求默认 URI 时于 action 参数中构造并传入经 URL 编码的 `..%2F`（即编码后的点点斜杠）序列，即可突破程序预期的路径限制，使应用程序包含并执行服务器上的任意本地文件。该漏洞属于典型的本地文件包含（LFI）类问题，攻击者借此可读取到本不应暴露的敏感文件（如配置文件、源码等），进而可能获取系统凭据或进一步推进攻击。其触发条件简单，仅需向目标站点发送特制的 HTTP 请求即可，CVSS 评分 6.8，危害等级为中高危，主要影响部署了相关版本 Chyrp 博客系统的 Web 服务器。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.8,"aliases":["CVE-2011-2744"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2011-07-19T20:55:01.257","updated":"2026-06-16T23:31:54.793","remediation":"升级 Chyrp 到官方修复版本（2.1 之后的 2.x 版本，建议查阅项目仓库获取含路径遍历修复的提交）；若无法立即升级，可在 Web 服务器（如 Apache/Nginx）配置中拦截向默认 URI 传入含 ..%2F 编码序列的 action 参数请求，并限制 PHP 仅可包含白名单目录内文件作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-15T00:00:00Z","references":["http://osvdb.org/73890","http://secunia.com/advisories/45184","http://securityreason.com/securityalert/8312","http://www.justanotherhacker.com/advisories/JAHx113.txt","http://www.ocert.org/advisories/ocert-2011-001.html","http://www.openwall.com/lists/oss-security/2011/07/13/5","http://www.openwall.com/lists/oss-security/2011/07/13/6","http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/518890/100/0/threaded","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/48672","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/68564","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/35945","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2011/CVE-2011-2744.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/8600ac0c091970175de0b53d9682f50858aef8dc/2011/CVE-2011-2744.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/6bfef5eb290cbfeb2b2cb4d2bae8e5cab0243137/http/cves/2011/CVE-2011-2744.yaml","https://github.com/sepehrdaddev/zap-scripts/blob/2b63b02ca79cc7f0023cdbab72c5c6c774354b07/active/CVE-2011-2744.js","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/CVE-2011-2780.yaml","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/8b3d6ccb0f4e9e36a888697a7de582054e8c5bc9/2011/CVE-2011-2744.json","https://github.com/kaismax/CVE-Poc/blob/6d8c93dabf674cea102713781cc534d577412357/2011/CVE-2011-2744.md","https://github.com/exploit-io/nuclei-templates/blob/a4b7182985a6e45df346cfe45242d40455e152b5/templates/cve-2011-2744-2047.yaml","https://github.com/adampielak/nuclei-templates/blob/ac9605f5a915670fd80cb4e1904f4435f1835b65/nuclei-v2/C/CVE-2011-2744-2048.yaml","https://github.com/PwnAwan/CVEs/blob/967839a1f3dd2e43c3ca7af98749ae1712e69a04/2011/CVE-2011-2780.md","https://github.com/Ciyfly/woodpecker/blob/f88bed6da55238547a423ce17dccb2cdbc93be50/pocs/nuclei/cves/2011/CVE-2011-2744.yaml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2011/AVE-2011-0007.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2011-0066","file_name":"2011/AVE-2011-0066.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2011-1889","title":"Microsoft Forefront Threat Management Gateway (TMG) 防火墙客户端远程代码执行漏洞","description":"tags.<value>Microsoft Forefront Threat Management Gateway (TMG) 2010 防火墙客户端中的 NSPLookupServiceNext 函数存在内存破坏漏洞，未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过向目标系统发送特制请求触发该漏洞，导致远程代码执行。该漏洞影响 Microsoft Forefront TMG 2010 版本，CVSS 评分 9.8，危害等级严重。该漏洞已被 CISA KEV 收录，存在在野利用。Microsoft 已于 2011 年 6 月安全更新 MS11-040 中修复此漏洞。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.8,"aliases":["CVE-2011-1889"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2011-06-16T20:55:02.543","updated":"2026-06-16T23:30:18.967","remediation":"立即安装 Microsoft 安全公告 MS11-040 提供的更新 (KB2520426)，将 Forefront TMG 2010 Client 升级至文件版本 7.0.7734.182。可通过 Microsoft Update 自动获取更新，或从 Microsoft 下载中心手动下载安装包 (TMG-KB2520426-ENU.msp)，使用命令 msiexec /p TMG-KB2520426-ENU.msp /quiet 静默安装后重启系统。如无法立即打补丁，可临时禁用 TMG 2010 Client 服务作为缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://secunia.com/advisories/44857","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/48181","http://www.securitytracker.com/id?1025637","https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/2011/ms11-040","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/67736","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A12642","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2011-1889","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2011/CVE-2011-1889.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/7d4778b18ea29de57c8a889212050a9d38e2d2cb/cves/2011/1xxx/CVE-2011-1889.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2011/CVE-2011-1889","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/2726c8e981acc1c694a4bf2f24fcc9360825f783/2011/1xxx/CVE-2011-1889.json","https://github.com/fankh/vulnerability-poc/blob/ffa50060b7ba6ae58d60d6d90533e77eaf10d466/2011/CVE-2011-1889/README.md","https://github.com/a-dhaou-tekup/VRA/blob/3e4f21c329250c5eca327489d3fd5be9b398ce7b/data/rag_corpus/cisa_kev_notes/CVE-2011-1889.txt","https://github.com/cyberdudebivash/cyberdudebivash-ai-security-hub/blob/13403e1745f63237e7ef6d51562fb36112320d77/frontend/cve/CVE-2011-1889.html","https://github.com/lucacapacci/cisa_kev/blob/730547e3121e93fb4d300346c9d4aa5d5b39b4fc/data_single/2011/CVE-2011-1889.csv","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2011/CVE-2011-1889.md","https://github.com/xqcyberscore/nvt/blob/978f6a9acb495d7d669239530ffe6da5d631f4da/2011/secpod_ms11-040.nasl"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2011/AVE-2011-0066.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2011-0055","file_name":"2011/AVE-2011-0055.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2011-1823","title":"Open Handset Alliance Android vold 卷管理整数溢出权限提升漏洞","description":"Android vold 卷管理守护进程在处理 PF_NETLINK 套接字消息时存在整数溢出漏洞，未对负索引进行有效边界检查，导致内存破坏。本地攻击者可通过向 vold 发送特制的 NETLINK 消息触发该漏洞，成功利用后可提升至 root 权限执行任意代码。该漏洞影响 Android 2.x 至 3.0 版本（2.3.4 之前），Gingerbreak 工具已公开其利用方法。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.8,"aliases":["CVE-2011-1823"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2011-06-09T10:36:27.680","updated":"2026-06-16T23:30:11.197","remediation":"升级 Android 系统至 2.3.4 或更高版本，该版本在 DirectVolume::handlePartitionAdded 方法中修复了符号整数检查缺陷，阻止了通过 PF_NETLINK 套接字发送负索引值触发内存破坏的本地提权攻击。如无法升级，可限制本地 shell 访问权限作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://android.git.kernel.org/?p=platform/system/core.git%3Ba=commit%3Bh=b620a0b1c7ae486e979826200e8e441605b0a5d6","http://android.git.kernel.org/?p=platform/system/netd.git%3Ba=commit%3Bh=79b579c92afc08ab12c0a5788d61f2dd2934836f","http://android.git.kernel.org/?p=platform/system/vold.git%3Ba=commit%3Bh=c51920c82463b240e2be0430849837d6fdc5352e","http://androidcommunity.com/gingerbreak-root-for-gingerbread-app-20110421/","http://c-skills.blogspot.com/2011/04/yummy-yummy-gingerbreak.html","http://forum.xda-developers.com/showthread.php?t=1044765","http://www.androidpolice.com/2011/05/03/google-patches-gingerbreak-exploit-but-dont-worry-we-still-have-root-for-now/","http://xorl.wordpress.com/2011/04/28/android-vold-mpartminors-signedness-issue/","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/67977","https://www.cisa.gov/