入经过 URL 编码的 `..%2F`（即编码后的\"点点斜杠\"）序列，借此跨越 Web 根目录限制并读取服务器上的任意文件（如配置文件、源码或敏感系统文件）。该漏洞影响所有安装并使用此插件 0.5.0.1 版本的 WordPress 站点，利用条件仅需攻击者能够网络访问目标站点的 wp-download.php 接口，无需身份认证，通过构造恶意 HTTP 请求即可实现任意文件读取。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2011-1669"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2011-04-10T02:51:20.167","updated":"2026-06-16T23:29:47.217","remediation":"建议立即升级 WordPress 插件 WP Custom Pages 至 0.5.0.2 或更高版本（官方已修复该目录遍历漏洞）。如暂时无法升级，可通过 Web 应用防火墙（WAF）或 Nginx/Apache 配置规则拦截包含 `..%2F` 或 `../` 等路径遍历序列的 `url` 参数请求，或临时禁用该插件的 `wp-download.php` 文件访问权限作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-15T00:00:00Z","references":["http://osvdb.org/71707","http://secunia.com/advisories/43963","http://www.autosectools.com/Advisories/WordPress.WP.Custom.Pages.0.5.0.1_Local.File.Inclusion_169.html","http://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/17119","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/47146","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/66559","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/17119","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2011/CVE-2011-1669.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/8600ac0c091970175de0b53d9682f50858aef8dc/2011/CVE-2011-1669.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/6bfef5eb290cbfeb2b2cb4d2bae8e5cab0243137/http/cves/2011/CVE-2011-1669.yaml","https://github.com/sepehrdaddev/zap-scripts/blob/2b63b02ca79cc7f0023cdbab72c5c6c774354b07/active/CVE-2011-1669.js","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/c8e5b5fa7d3cc58de338ca5a0a33eeafcde1afac/CVE-2011/CVE-2011-16xx/CVE-2011-1669.json","https://github.com/masahiro331/nvd-list/blob/4937ab886b2d99e2047bc7eafc242f2653ee7558/cves/2011/CVE-2011-1669.json","https://github.com/adampielak/nuclei-templates/blob/ac9605f5a915670fd80cb4e1904f4435f1835b65/nuclei-v3/C/CVE-2011-1669_19.yaml","https://github.com/emadshanab/nucleiDB/blob/a06eb8edf2853662c304e3f41f8887b65f56e399/cve-2011-1669-2045.yaml","https://github.com/linuxadi/40k-nuclei-templates/blob/542be